{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[F]Al[C]le[F]lu-ia! [Bb]sing [F]to [C]Je[C7]sus! [F]His [Gm]the [F]scepter, [Gm]His [C]the [F]throne;
[Dm]Al[C]le[F]lu-ia! [Gm]His[F]the [C]triumph, [F]His [Gm]the [F]vic[Am]to[Gm]ry [C]a[F]lone;
[Am]Hark! the [Dm7]songs of [Gm]peaceful [C7]Sion [A]Thunder [Dm]like a [Gm]might-y [C]flood;
[F]Je[Am]sus [Gm]out [C7]of [F]every [C]na[C7]tion [F]Hath re[Gm]deemed us [F]by [C7]His [F]blood.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[F][C]Alleluia! [F]not [Bb]as [F][C]orphans [C7]are [F]we [Gm][F]left [Gm]in [C]sorrow [F]now;
[Dm][C]Alleluia! [F]He [Gm]is [F][C]near [F]us, [Gm]faith [F][Am]believes, [Gm]nor [C]questions [F]how;
[Am]Though [Dm7]the cloud [Gm]from [C7]sight received [A]Him when [Dm]the [Gm]forty days [C]were o'er
[F][Am]Shall [Gm]our [C7]hearts [F]forget [C]His [C7]promise, [F]"I [Gm]am [F]with [C7]you [F]evermore"?
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[F][C]Alleluia! [F]bread [Bb]of [F]angels, [C]Thou [C7][F]on [Gm]earth [F]our [Gm]food, [C]our [F]stay;
[Dm][C]Alleluia! [F]here [Gm]the [F]sinful [C]flee [F][Gm]to [F]Thee [Am]from [Gm]day [C]to [F]day:
[Am]Intercessor, [Dm7]Friend [Gm]of [C7]sinners, [A]Earth's [Dm]Redeemer, [Gm]plead [C]for me,
[F]Where [Am]the [Gm]songs [C7]of [F]all [C]the [C7]sinless [F]sweep [Gm]across [F]the [C7]crystal [F]sea.
{end_of_verse}
